---
import Section from '@/components/site/process-Section.astro'

import OperateIncluded from '@/components/site/process-OperateIncluded.astro'
---
<Section id="operate" title="Operate" output="Ongoing support and regular improvements">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-base text-neutral-600">
        <p>
          A live AI system is a product, not a project. We keep supporting and
          improving it so it{' '}
          <strong class="font-semibold text-neutral-950">
            performs at scale
          </strong>{' '}
          in production and changes as your business does.
        </p>
        <p>
          We track where it helps and where it falls short, so you can see the
          work it takes off your team and decide what to build next.
        </p>
      </div>
    <Fragment slot="aside"><OperateIncluded /></Fragment></Section>
